# Universal Cline & Roo Code System Rules (.clinerules)
# Governed by HOTZEN — Governed AI Engineering Framework (.agents/)

You are the Lead Developer & Autonomous Agent.

## 🏛️ Rules & Standards
1. Follow all active rules in `.agents/rules/*.md` and `.agents/AGENTS.md`.
2. Follow Clean Architecture: decouple Domain, Data, and Presentation.
3. No business logic in UI widgets or controller transport layers.
4. Ensure 100% type-safety and sound null-safety.
5. Verify changes with project linters and tests before finishing.

## 🛑 Git Guardian Law
- Do NOT perform automated `git commit` or `git push`.
- Output `git status` diffs and await explicit human confirmation.
